{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest Time combines puzzle elements with tactical gameplay. Play as dwellers and guests, the fantasy forest dwellers, helping them meet their goals in this peaceful, family-friendly turn-based puzzle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can plan your actions carefully to complete everything on time, or experiment and explore the levels to your heart\u2019s content. The game is set in a peaceful environment and doesn\u2019t punish you for learning through trial and error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/promo_tile_5mb.gif?t=1748678459\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variety of Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many characters in the game, and each one is unique in its way. Explore their abilities and quirks in various settings and master each one of them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many levels to solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With more than 40 puzzles, there are many tasks to solve: from collecting fruits and berries and chatting with friends to trick-or-treating or playing with spirits during seasonal festive events.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3166730?t=1748678459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3166730?t=1748678459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/a0beb95cc6f91ab79383a50da743b3891397e94f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748678459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/a0beb95cc6f91ab79383a50da743b3891397e94f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748678459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest Time combines puzzle elements with tactical gameplay. Play as dwellers and guests, the fantasy forest dwellers, helping them meet their goals in this peaceful, family-friendly turn-based puzzle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can plan your actions carefully to complete everything on time, or experiment and explore the levels to your heart\u2019s content. The game is set in a peaceful environment and doesn\u2019t punish you for learning through trial and error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/promo_tile_5mb.gif?t=1748678459\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variety of Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are many characters in the game, and each one is unique in its way. Explore their abilities and quirks in various settings and master each one of them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many levels to solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With more than 40 puzzles, there are many tasks to solve: from collecting fruits and berries and chatting with friends to trick-or-treating or playing with spirits during seasonal festive events.</p>","developers":["Wandering Peak"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/header.jpg?t=1748678459","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ or equvalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.50Ghz Intel core i3, Apple M1 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></l